    "extended_mode_unavailable": {
      "title": "SAX Extended Mode unreachable",
      "description": "The Extended Mode register block (slave ID {slave_id}) of the SAX storage system is unreachable. Sensors that depend on it (SunSpec readings, smart meter detail values) show \"unknown\" until the connection is restored. Basic Mode sensors (state of charge, charge/discharge power, switch) are not affected. Please check whether Extended Mode is enabled on the SAX gateway and whether the configured slave ID (Extended Mode) is correct."
